==About==
'''RLCS Season 8 ''' is the second [[RLCS]] season in 2019. This marks the [[RLCS]] season prior to where [https://www.epicgames.com/site/en-US/home Epic Games] has acquired Psyonix - the developer of ''Rocket League''.<ref name="epic games">{{cite web|url=https://www.rocketleague.com/news/psyonix-is-joining-the-epic-family-/|title=Psyonix is joining the Epic Family!|date=2019-05-01|author=[[Psyonix]]}}</ref> The main change to the season comes in the [[Rocket League Rival Series]] as the second division in the [[RLCS]] has been extended to 10 teams from 8.<ref name=ten teams">{{cite web|url=https://www.rocketleagueesports.com/news/announcing-rlcs-season-8-and-the-improved-rival-series/|title=Improved Rival Series|date=2019-08-12|author=[[Ian Nowakowski]]}}</ref>

The World Championship finals took place in Madrid, Spain at the [https://www.palaciovistalegre.com/ Palacio Vistalegre].

