===Format===
*'''Group Stage''' - ''December 13th-14th''
**12 teams split into 2 groups of 6.
**Double Elimination Bracket.
***All matches {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
**Top 3 - 6 in total - advances to the [[#Playoffs|Playoffs]]. The winner of each group receives a bye into the Semifinals.
*'''Playoffs''' - ''December 15th''
**Single Elimination Bracket.
***All matches {{Abbr/Bo7}}.

